Description: BirdsLikeWires firmware for the OpenFrame 1 and 2 (26.11.32)
 The OpenFrame 1 and 2 EFI firmware release 26.11.32, and
 of-firmware-update, which brings the chip to it
 from stock O2, Verizon or Telstra firmware on an OpenFrame 1, stock Cisco,
 Telio, Avaya or OpenPeak firmware on an OpenFrame 2, or an earlier release,
 at the next boot (of-firmware.service), in an order where a power
 cut at any point leaves a chip that starts. Firmware it does not
 recognise is left alone.

